n spending. Local coverage highlights contested advertising claims and a growing Democratic registration edge in the district. With no reliable public general-election polls, the race rests on fundamentals and ratings, pointing to a narrow Democratic edge with wide uncertainty.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5916, "margin": 1.42}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6449, "margin": 2.0}]}